{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Self-RAG 工作原理与反思令牌\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\nSelf-RAG 是什么？它如何通过反思令牌（Reflection Tokens）实现主动检索？请详细描述其工作流程和四种反思令牌的作用。\n\n## 答案\n\n**Self-RAG** 是一种自适应检索增强生成框架，核心思想是让 LLM **自主判断是否需要检索**，并在生成过程中持续自我验证，而非传统 RAG 的\"先检索后生成\"固定流程。\n\n**核心创新：反思令牌（Reflection Tokens）**\n\nSelf-RAG 在 LLM 的词表中引入 4 种特殊 Token，让模型具备\"元认知\"能力：\n\n| 令牌 | 全称 | 作用 | 可选值 |\n|------|------|------|--------|\n| **Retrieve** | 检索决策 | 判断当前是否需要检索 | yes, no, continue |\n| **ISREL** | Is Relevant | 评估检索文档与问题的相关性 | relevant, irrelevant |\n| **ISSUP** | Is Supported | 验证生成内容是否有检索证据支持 | fully, partially, no |\n| **ISUSE** | Is Useful | 评估最终答案的整体质量 | 1-5 分数 |\n\n**Self-RAG 的完整工作流程：**\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">用户问题: \"iPhone 15 Pro 的电池容量是多少？\"<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\nStep 1: 生成 Retrieve Token<br>\nLLM 判断: \"这个问题需要最新产品信息\"<br>\nRetrieve = yes<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\nStep 2: 执行检索<br>\n从知识库检索 Top-K 文档<br>\n│<br>\n├── 文档1: \"iPhone 15 Pro 评测：外观设计惊艳\"<br>\n│   ISREL = irrelevant（不相关，过滤掉）<br>\n│<br>\n├── 文档2: \"iPhone 15 Pro 电池容量 4400mAh\"<br>\n│   ISREL = relevant（相关，保留）<br>\n│<br>\n└── 文档3: \"iPhone 15 系列续航测试\"<br>\n│   ISREL = relevant（相关，保留）<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\nStep 3: 生成答案 + ISSUP 验证<br>\n生成: \"iPhone 15 Pro 的电池容量是 4400mAh\"<br>\nISSUP = fully supported（文档2有证据）<br>\n│<br>\n生成: \"iPhone 15 Pro 支持量子充电\"<br>\nISSUP = not supported（无证据，删除或标注不确定）<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\nStep 4: ISUSE 整体评分<br>\n最终答案: \"iPhone 15 Pro 的电池容量是 4400mAh\"<br>\nISUSE = 5（准确、完整、有依据）</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**反思令牌的工作机制详解：**\n\n**1. Retrieve（检索决策）**\n- **yes**：需要检索（如问题涉及时效性信息或特定事实）\n- **no**：不需要检索（如通用常识问题）\n- **continue**：在前一步检索的基础上继续生成\n\n**2. ISREL（文档相关性）**\n对检索到的每个文档打分：\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">文档: \"iPhone 15 Pro 评测：外观设计惊艳\"<br>\n问题: \"iPhone 15 Pro 的电池容量是多少？\"<br>\nISREL = irrelevant（文档讲的是外观，不是电池）<br>\n→ 该文档被过滤，不参与后续生成</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**3. ISSUP（事实支撑度）**\n生成过程中每段内容都标注是否有检索证据：\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生成内容: \"电池容量是 4400mAh\"<br>\n检索文档: \"iPhone 15 Pro 电池容量：4400mAh\"<br>\nISSUP = fully supported ✓</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生成内容: \"支持量子充电\"<br>\n检索文档: 无相关内容<br>\nISSUP = not supported ✗ → 删除或标注\"未验证\"</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**4. ISUSE（答案实用性）**\n对最终答案的整体评分（1-5分），用于：\n- 多个候选答案中选择最优\n- 触发重新检索（分数过低时）\n- 人工审核标记（分数低的优先审核）\n\n**Self-RAG 的训练：**\n\nSelf-RAG 需要构造带反思令牌标注的训练数据，通过监督微调让 LLM 学会生成这些特殊 Token。\n\n```python\n# 训练数据格式示例\ntrain_data = [\n    {\n        \"question\": \"iPhone 15 Pro 电池容量?\",\n        \"output\": \"&lt;Retrieve&gt;yes&lt;/Retrieve&gt;\\n\"\n                  \"&lt;ISREL&gt;relevant&lt;/ISREL&gt; iPhone 15 Pro 电池容量 4400mAh\\n\"\n                  \"&lt;ISSUP&gt;fully&lt;/ISSUP&gt; iPhone 15 Pro 的电池容量是 4400mAh\\n\"\n                  \"&lt;ISUSE&gt;5&lt;/ISUSE&gt;\"\n    }\n]\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Self-RAG vs 传统 RAG：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 RAG</th>\n<th>Self-RAG</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>检索时机</td>\n<td>固定：查询时先检索</td>\n<td>动态：模型判断是否需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索次数</td>\n<td>单次</td>\n<td>可多次（递归检索）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档过滤</td>\n<td>无或简单阈值</td>\n<td>ISREL 精确过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幻觉检测</td>\n<td>外部检测</td>\n<td>ISSUP 内置验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量控制</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>ISUSE 自动评分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Self-RAG 适合什么场景？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 1) 需要判断检索必要性的场景（通用问题不需要检索）；2) 对答案准确性要求高的场景（ISSUP 验证）；3) 多跳推理场景（递归检索）。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Self-RAG 的训练成本如何？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 需要大量带反思标注的数据，标注成本高。但推理时不需要额外模型，一个模型同时完成决策和生成。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Self-RAG 不需要检索</strong> — 它是在需要时检索，不是完全不检索</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思令牌只是 Prompt 技巧</strong> — 它们是模型词表的一部分，需要专门训练</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Self-RAG 适合所有场景</strong> — 简单场景下传统 RAG 更直接高效</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q14&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q14: 如何用 LangChain 实现一个完整的 RAG 系统？请写出核心代码\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q14: 如何用 LangChain 实现一个完整的 RAG 系统？请写出核心代码</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}